1
00:00:16,722 --> 00:00:22,286
All of us! For our Country,
for our Glory and Flag!

2
00:00:23,263 --> 00:00:28,771
Our valor and our writings
are the envy of the ages

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,406
Our mountain and our valley,
they bring forth stalwart men

4
00:00:34,456 --> 00:00:38,779
And to Perfection we devote
our words and labor

5
00:00:38,813 --> 00:00:43,493
All of us! For our Country,
for our Glory and Flag!

6
00:00:45,464 --> 00:00:47,884
All of us! For our Country!